      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# MobileNetV2+TSM — Evaluation-Only Repetition-Layout Control (FIXED)\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook isolates repetition-layout sensitivity without retraining.\n",
        "\n",
        "For each checkpoint, `K=2` and `K=4` are evaluated with **both**:\n",
        "- grouped repetition, e.g. `A A B B C C D D`\n",
        "- interleaved repetition, e.g. `A B C D A B C D`\n",
        "\n",
        "For a fixed dataset/clip/K/repeat, the selected distinct frames are identical\n",
        "between layouts; only their ordering changes.\n",
        "\n",
        "Primary checkpoints:\n",
        "1. `T=8, K_train=4, train_layout=grouped`\n",
        "2. `T=8, K_train=8` (native)\n",
        "\n",
        "An already-trained `K_train=4 interleaved` checkpoint can be enabled with one\n",
        "flag if a stronger train-layout control is desired.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Evaluation only: no training, optimizer, or train/validation split.**\n"
      ]
    },
